  "item_short_desc": "<p>Upgrade your loadout with Rothco&rsquo;s Deluxe Triple Retention Duty Belt&mdash;a capable and durable essential for professionals. This 2-inch wide belt is perfect for mounting holders, cases, and more, ensuring seamless gear management in the field. Comfort is key, and this belt fits comfortably through most standard-sized belt loops, allowing for easy movement and flexibility. The triple retention buckle, featuring a two-pronged clip buckle reinforced by a push-button closure, guarantees a duty belt that never comes loose.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "3052",
  "description": "<p>Upgrade your loadout with Rothco&rsquo;s Deluxe Triple Retention Duty Belt&mdash;a capable and durable essential for professionals. This 2-inch wide belt is perfect for mounting holders, cases, and more, ensuring seamless gear management in the field. Comfort is key, and this belt fits comfortably through most standard-sized belt loops, allowing for easy movement and flexibility. The triple retention buckle, featuring a two-pronged clip buckle reinforced by a push-button closure, guarantees a duty belt that never comes loose, providing the reliability needed in high-pressure situations. Designed for convenience, the inside hook material facilitates attachment to an inner duty belt, enhancing stability and functionality during duty. With a wide size range from 32 to 50 inches, this belt accommodates various waist sizes, ensuring a personalized fit for every professional. Invest in Rothco's Triple Retention Duty Belt for a robust and dependable addition to your gear. Elevate your performance and confidence in the field with the quality and functionality that Rothco consistently delivers.</p>",
